  (limitation "Sixteen finite predeclared witnesses: each of the seven loads with rd = x0 still raising its access fault and reporting its own address, one such load that does not fault, and x0 still reading zero; a load to x0 writes no GPR, so each witness is the handler's read; the other side effects a load may cause are not witnessed; full source/risk/feature policy remains pending.")
  (source_id "RVI-RV32I") (source_locator "1.1.6") (category "defined") (risk "high")
  (coverage "sixteen witnesses: seven loads to x0, each faulting at its own address, and one that does not fault")
